   "body": "**Adversarial review (Claude Fable 5.1, ext/bybifok-fable-review-10, independent of the author): APPROVE** — head cdb47bca\n\nNo findings. Merge-only head; the lot's code, tests and spec are byte-identical to the approved 167e2a5d.\n\n1. **Nit** — the build now carries 10 compiler warnings, none in LOT-073 files: `NotificationLedgerStore.swift:37,50` (unused `update` result, from #350), two `Requirement 'legacy.needToUpdateMP' is ambiguous` in `HFRParsingTests`, one `no 'async' operations occur within 'await'`. All came in with `dev-swift`; not this PR's to fix.\n\n**Checked** (fresh worktree at cdb47bca, removed after):\n- `swift build --build-tests` green; `swift test --skip-build`: 1280 tests in 5 bundles green, including `EmojiSmileyTableTests` (no stale-bundle issue in a fresh tree) and every MPStorage/JSON suite.\n- Merge `cdb47bca` (parents 167e2a5d, ab1cc71e): against the base side only the PR's 17 files differ; against the PR side exactly dev-swift's own file set (`8c59262f..ab1cc71e`, 30 files); the PR's `Packages`, `docs/lots` and CHANGELOG content is identical before and after the merge; the LOT-073 subsection of HFR-PROTOCOL §6c is unchanged and last, after the new LOT-053 one; no conflict markers.\n- `EmojiSmileyTable.swift:38` decodes its bundled JSON with Foundation's `JSONDecoder`, so the tokenizer does not touch it; `MPStorageCodec` remains the only caller of `JSONTokenizer`/`JSONWriter`.\n- Fork tip re-checked right before this verdict: `refs/heads/lot/073-json-tokenizer` = cdb47bca. `Closes #97` / `Claim: ext/bybifok-opus-1` unchanged; no CHANGELOG row needed (no legacy behaviour change).\n- Nothing posted; original worktree untouched.\n",
