   "body": "**Adversarial review (Claude Fable 5.1, ext/bybifok-fable-review-10, independent of the author): APPROVE** — head 3e951937\n\nNo findings. Merge-only head: the lot's code, tests and spec are byte-identical to the approved cdb47bca / 167e2a5d.\n\n1. **Nit** — LOT-052's `documentError` (`MPStorageTransport+Helpers.swift:62`) folds any non-`MPStorageError` from `encodeForWriting` into `.invalidDocument`; that includes `EncodingError` for a `JSONNumber(Double.nan)` in a foreign namespace, as it did with `JSONEncoder` before. Unchanged by this lot, just noting the one path where both lots meet.\n\n**Checked** (fresh worktree at 3e951937, removed after):\n- `swift build --build-tests` green, zero warnings in MPStorage/JSON files; `swift test --skip-build`: 1346 tests in 5 bundles green, including the eight MPStorage/JSON suites and LOT-052's `MPStorageTransportReadTests`, `MPStorageTransportWriteTests`, `MPStorageListWalkTests`.\n- Merge `3e951937` (parents cdb47bca, 011f8757): against the base side only the PR's 17 files differ; against the PR side exactly dev-swift's own file set (`ab1cc71e..011f8757`); the PR's `Packages` and `docs/lots` content and its HFR-PROTOCOL additions are identical before and after the merge; no conflict markers.\n- Auto-merged files: `MPStoragePageParserTests.swift` keeps `writtenAsBefore` (lines 81-82); HFR-PROTOCOL §6c keeps LOT-073 last after LOT-053; `LOT-062-mpstorage-merge.md` keeps LOT-073's \"own tokenizer and writer, which keep the lexemes\" sentence with no `JSONNumberBox`/marker wording left (dev-swift's side only changed the legacy repository link).\n- LOT-052 through the tree coders: it calls only `MPStorageCodec.decode` and `encodeForWriting` (`validateWritable` indirectly via LOT-062 mutations); no reference to `JSONNumberBox`, the U+E000 marker, `JSONEncoder`, `sortedKeys` or `withoutEscapingSlashes` in its sources, tests or spec. Its byte comparisons are page text versus `MPStorageCapture.storedText` (codec-independent) and `content_form` versus the codec's own `encodeForWriting` output, plus `snapshot.document == decode(storedText)`; all green.\n- Fork tip re-checked right before this verdict: `lot/073-json-tokenizer` = 3e951937. `Closes #97` / `Claim: ext/bybifok-opus-1` unchanged; no CHANGELOG row needed. The cdb47bca CI failure was the iOS app test `ForumSessionCheckTests/loginDuringARecheckWinsOverItsResult` timing out — not in HFRKit, unrelated to MPStorage.\n- Nothing posted; original worktree untouched.\n",
